            "topic": "MIXTURE OF EXPERTS",
            "segment": "Mixture of Experts",
            "command": "Models keep shipping with parameter counts that look impossible to serve, and then people serve them. Can you show me what a Mixture of Experts actually does — what the router is choosing, why the model can be enormous and cheap at the same time, and which of the two numbers on the box I should be budgeting for?",
